                              "fill": "$text-secondary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Call audio and video are end-to-end encrypted; the relay forwards packets it can't read. Its logins are minted by the API for one call and named at random, so even its own records don't say whose call it was.",
