                                  "name": "Detail",
                                  "fill": "$text-tertiary",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "With REDIS_URL set, every replica shares one counter. Without it, or while Redis is unreachable, each process counts on its own; a Redis outage never lets more through.",
