      "name": "Privacy checks · Checking",
      "context": "Check again, mid-run. The server answers every check in one response: while it works a scan band sweeps the list, the bar under the card head runs indeterminate and the tiles show a dash. Then the answers land one row every 80 ms: the pill pops in over a short wash of its tone, the next row shows Checking with an accent wash and a 2 px accent edge, rows still to come show an empty pill and dimmed text, the tiles count up and the bar fills. The side cards dim until the run ends. Reduced motion shows the result at once.",
